  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation study on Danish policy influence on development partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose for the study is twofold: 
1) to analyse Denmark&apos;s ability to influence policy reform processes in partner countries;
2) to analyse the determining factors for such influencing work to be deemed useful and helpful by partners in bringing forward reform processes in partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
